WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:08,660
The big boss is kind and righteous.

2
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:12,360
Collect supplies and clean up all these contaminated things.

3
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:14,960
You didn’t ruin other people’s factories either, right?

4
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,420
Finally sue them

5
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:20,380
I always thought that places where people had died would be spooky.

6
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:22,540
But if you follow them like this

7
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,140
On the contrary, I feel that the factory has exceeded the quantity.

8
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:29,080
Those things that were left behind were not disturbed.

9
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:33,960
There's no telling if their families will find this place again in the future.

10
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:40,690
The factory area has been cleaned up

11
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:42,090
If you have to pay it back two days late

12
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:43,890
Wait until we replace the supplies

13
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:50,500
Are there any residents here who need to exchange supplies?

14
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:52,860
Yes, yes

15
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:54,660
Materials are in short supply now

16
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:58,660
More than one of my relatives and friends have talked about it

17
00:00:58,660 --> 00:01:01,260
It would be nice if the factory didn't lose anything.

18
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:09,280
All that salt and sugar can be used.

19
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:11,380
I'll give you a call

20
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:14,380
Custody can call in a bunch of people who need to exchange supplies.
